From: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp: Fix GPU SMMU context fault
 interrupts

The GPU SMMU interrupt list includes PMU interrupts as the first two
context fault interrupts. This makes the driver register context fault
handlers on the wrong IRQs, leaving translation faults unhandled and
potentially stalling the GPU and preventing recovery.

Replace the context interrupt list with SPIs 680 through 688 and 703 in
context bank order to describe all ten hardware context interrupts.

Fixes: eec51ab2fd6f ("arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp: Add GPU related nodes")
Signed-off-by: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261014-sc8280xp-gpu-smmu-fix-v2-1-eaba3afecba5@radxa.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>
Origin: backport, https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/qcom/linux.git/commit/?id=89083b1e9e315805a93ca6a6e4c3515c7855b0a4
Upstream-Status: Backport [qcom arm64-for-7.5, 89083b1e9e31]
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi
index 7805bdf036..b8c9015167 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp.dtsi
@@ -3554,8 +3554,6 @@ gpu_smmu: iommu@3da0000 {
 			#global-interrupts = <2>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 672 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 673 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
-				     <GIC_SPI 678 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
-				     <GIC_SPI 679 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 680 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 681 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 682 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
@@ -3565,7 +3563,7 @@ gpu_smmu: iommu@3da0000 {
 				     <GIC_SPI 686 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 687 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 				     <GIC_SPI 688 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
-				     <GIC_SPI 689 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+				     <GIC_SPI 703 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 
 			clocks = <&gcc GCC_GPU_MEMNOC_GFX_CLK>,
 				 <&gcc GCC_GPU_SNOC_DVM_GFX_CLK>,
